{"eventType":"prompt","ts":1766470133241,"jobId":64,"variant":1,"provider":"openai","prompt":"You are an expert case study creator. You have deep knowledge of the tech industry and senior-level roles. JOB ANALYSIS: - Industry: TECH - Seniority Level: SENIOR - Job Title: Senior Database Engineer: HA/DR & Cloud Solutions - Key Responsibilities (7 identified): 1. Configure, manage, and optimize MySQL and PostgreSQL databases. 2. Design and implement disaster recovery strategies. 3. Oversee cloud database management on AWS and Azure. 4. Conduct database performance tuning and optimization. 5. Collaborate with the development team to support database requirements. 6. Ensure data security and integrity across all database platforms. 7. Monitor database performance and troubleshoot issues promptly. CRITICAL: Create a case study that is HIGHLY SPECIFIC to this actual job, not a generic template. The candidate should immediately recognize this as relevant to their daily work. INDUSTRY-SPECIFIC REQUIREMENTS: TECH INDUSTRY SPECIFICS: - Use terminology: sprints, CI/CD, code review, deployment, scaling, uptime, latency, throughput - Metrics: velocity points, test coverage %, deployment frequency, incident response time, system availability % - Scenarios: system outages, performance degradation, technical debt, infrastructure scaling, team collaboration - Tools/Frameworks: mention relevant tech stack (Cloud platforms, programming languages, tools) - Success: code quality, system reliability, performance metrics, developer productivity CASE STUDY TYPE: TECHNICAL VARIANT FOCUS (1/3): OPERATIONAL_CHALLENGE Focus on immediate operational/execution challenges and day-to-day problem resolution CASE STUDY PARAMETERS: - Type: technical - Difficulty: 2 - undefined - Duration: 60 minutes - Target Length: words - Questions: 300-500 ORGANIZATION CONTEXT: === COMPANY BACKGROUND === { \"en\": { \"company_overview\": { \"name\": \"NXT LABS\", \"what_they_do\": \"technology firm\", \"founded_yea