ed: 2, codingChallenge: 1 - Module Breakdown: openEnded: 2, codingChallenge: 1 MODULE INSTRUCTIONS: For each selected module, generate the specified number of questions tied to the case study scenario. Annotate each question with its module type and provide module-specific metadata (e.g., MCQs must have 4 options and one correct answer; coding challenges must include test cases and sample input/output; video responses must include time limits and evaluation criteria). Ensure the overall number of questions matches the module breakdown. ORGANIZATION CONTEXT: === COMPANY BACKGROUND === { \"en\": { \"Company\": { \"Name\": \"Not Mentioned\", \"Industry\": \"Not Mentioned\", \"Founded\": \"Not Mentioned\" }, \"Scale\": { \"Employees\": \"Not Mentioned\", \"Offices\": \"Islamabad, Pakistan\", \"Countries\": \"Not Mentioned\" }, \"Expertise\": { \"Specializations\": \"Designing and implementing client-side and server-side applications\", \"MainProductsServices\": \"Software solutions\" }, \"Culture\": { \"MissionStatement\": \"Not Mentioned\", \"CoreValues\": \"Not Mentioned\", \"CompanyCulture\": \"Dynamic development team\" }, \"MarketPositionAchievements\": \"Not Mentioned\" }, \"ar\": { \"Company\": { \"Name\": \"غير مذكور\", \"Industry\": \"غير مذكور\", \"Founded\": \"غير مذكور\" }, \"Scale\": { \"Employees\": \"غير مذكور\", \"Offices\": \"إسلام آباد، باكستان\", \"Countries\": \"غير مذكور\" }, \"Expertise\": { \"Specializations\": \"تصميم وتنفيذ تطبيقات الجهة العميل والخادم\", \"MainProductsServices\": \"حلول البرمجيات\" }, \"Culture\": { \"MissionStatement\": \"غير مذكور\", \"CoreValues\": \"غير مذكور\", \"CompanyCulture\": \"فريق تطوير ديناميكي\" }, \"MarketPositionAchievements\": \"غير مذكور\" } } === END COMPANY BACKGROUND === === PSYCHOMETRIC ASSESSMENT INTEGRATION === Include psychometric evaluation elements for: cognitiveAbility, problemSolving COGNITIVE ABILITY ASSESSMENT: - Primary Focus: Measures analytical thinking, logical reasoning, pattern recognition, and mental processing speed. Evaluate how the candidate breaks down complex information. - Probe with: How do you approach complex analytical problems? / Walk through your logical reasoning / How would you brea"}
{"eventType":"response","ts":1767262917344,"jobId":65,"variant":1,"provider":"openai","response":"{ \"en\": { \"description\": \"The company is a tech company that specializes in designing and implementing client-side and server-side applications. It operates a dynamic development team based in Islamabad, Pakistan. Currently, the company is dealing with several operational challenges impacting their Full Stack Developer team. These challenges involve maintaining high system availability and optimizing application performance while managing technical debt. The team aims to enhance deployment frequency and improve code quality by addressing bottlenecks in the development cycle. The company is focused on scaling their infrastructure to handle increased workloads, ensuring low latency and high throughput for their applications. As part of this initiative, they are looking to optimize CI/CD processes and improve incident response times, thereby reducing downtime and enhancing system reliability. The company operates in a fast-paced environment where collaboration among cross-functional teams is critical, and staying updated with emerging technologies is essential for success. This scenario sets the stage for the Full Stack Developer role to address these specific operational challenges.\", \"instructions\": \"As the Full Stack Developer at the company, you are tasked with addressing the operational challenges impacting the development team. Your objectives include optimizing the CI/CD pipeline to increase deployment frequency and reduce incident response times, thereby improving system uptime and reliability. You must ensure that applications are optimized for maximum speed and scalability while maintaining high code quality and test coverage. You will collaborate with cross-functional teams to identify and resolve bottlenecks in the development process, focusing on solutions that improve latency and throughput. Your success will be measured by improvements in system availability metrics and developer productivity. You have access to cloud platforms and modern frameworks, but must work within budgetary constraints and limited team capacity. Stakeholder expectations include timely delivery of enhancements and proactive communication of progress. Your deliverables must be completed within a 60-day timeline, with regular updates provided to project leads.\", \"questions\": [ \"How would you optimize the CI/CD pipeline to address the challenges of deployment frequency and incident response times?\", \"Describe your approach to improving system reliability and uptime while managing technical debt.\", \"What strategies would you implement to enhance application performance in terms of latency and throughput?\", \"Explain how you would collaborate with cross-functional teams to resolve bottlenecks in the development cycle.\", \"How would you ensure high code quality and test coverage while working within budgetary and capacity constraints?\", \"What metrics would you use to measure the success of your optimizations, and how would you track improvements over time?\", \"Discuss the importance of staying updated with emerging technologies in your role as a Full Stack Developer.\" ], \"tables\": [ { \"table_id\": \"primary_metrics\", \"title\": \"Current Metrics & Performance\", \"description\": \"Key performance indicators for Full Stack Developer role\", \"columns\": [ {\"key\": \"metric_name\", \"label\": \"Metric\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"current_value\", \"label\": \"Current Value\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"target_value\", \"label\": \"Target\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"variance\", \"label\": \"Variance\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"key\": \"trend\", \"label\": \"Trend\", \"type\": \"select\", \"options\": [\"↑ Improving\", \"→ Stable\", \"↓ Declining\"]} ], \"rows\": [ {\"metric_name\": \"Deployment Frequency\", \"current_value\": \"3/week\", \"target_value\": \"5/week\", \"variance\": \"-40%\", \"trend\": \"↓ Declining\"}, {\"metric_name\": \"System Availability\", \"current_value\": \"99.2%\", \"target_value\": \"99.9%\", \"variance\": \"-0.7%\", \"trend\": \"↑ Improving\"}, {\"metric_name\": \"Incident Response Time\", \"current_value\": \"45 mins\", \"target_valu","length":11764}
{"eventType":"module_context","ts":1767262918575,"caseStudyId":469,"variant":1,"provider":"openai","context":"CASE STUDY DESCRIPTION: The company is a tech company that specializes in designing and implementing client-side and server-side applications. It operates a dynamic development team based in Islamabad, Pakistan. Currently, the company is dealing with several operational challenges impacting their Full Stack Developer team. These challenges involve maintaining high system availability and optimizing application performance while managing technical debt. The team aims to enhance deployment frequency and improve code quality by addressing bottlenecks in the development cycle. The company is focused on scaling their infrastructure to handle increased workloads, ensuring low latency and high throughput for their applications. As part of this initiative, they are looking to optimize CI/CD processes and improve incident response times, thereby reducing downtime and enhancing system reliability. The company operates in a fast-paced environment where collaboration among cross-functional teams is critical, and staying updated with emerging technologies is essential for success. This scenario sets the stage for the Full Stack Developer role to address these specific operational challenges. TABLE SUMMARIES: - Current Metrics & Performance: columns: Metric | Current Value | Target | Variance | Trend. sample_rows: {\"metric_name\":\"Deployment Frequency\",\"current_value\":\"3/week\",\"target_value\":\"5/week\",\"variance\":\"-40%\",\"trend\":\"↓ Declining\"} ; {\"metric_name\":\"System Availability\",\"current_value\":\"99.2%\",\"target_value\":\"99.9%\",\"variance\":\"-0.7%\",\"trend\":\"↑ Improving\"} ; {\"metric_name\":\"Incident Response Time\",\"current_value\":\"45 mins\",\"target_value\":\"30 mins\",\"variance\":\"+50%\",\"trend\":\"→ Stable\"} - Situation/Context Data: columns: Item | Status | Impact Level | Details. sample_rows: {\"item\":\"Infrastructure Scaling\",\"status\":\"Active\",\"impact\":\"High\",\"notes\":\"Requires additional cloud resources\"} ; {\"item\":\"Technical Debt Reduction\",\"status\":\"Pending\",\"impact\":\"Critical\",\"notes\":\"Need"}
